00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:51.398
Sorry you had to hear that.

00:03:51.439 --> 00:03:53.400
It's okay. We're family. This is a safe space.

00:03:53.441 --> 00:03:55.276
All right, bring it in.

00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:56.695
-We all ready? -Yep.

00:03:56.737 --> 00:03:58.155
-Absolutely. -Always.

00:03:58.197 --> 00:03:59.740
